  "details": "We all know the new EAC feature disabled our favourite mods. So here is some features the mods that I had that I want to see.\n-flight\nI know some avatars have it but why should you have to wear a specific avatar. \n-Portable mirrors\nThis would be extremely great for the world's without mirrors and it would also be great if desktop users can activate them as well as quest. \n-avatar search\nIt would be very helpful to search avatars that are listed as public by a user. But private avatars don't get listed. \n(All I can think of for now but comment what else you think vrchat should add)",
